### Seats
GET http://localhost:8080/events/100/seats

### Hold seats 1 and 2
POST http://localhost:8080/events/100/holds
X-Customer-Id: 42
Content-Type: application/json

{"seatIds": [1, 2]}

### Confirm (use the id returned above)
POST http://localhost:8080/holds/101/confirm
X-Customer-Id: 42

### Run the expiry job once
POST http://localhost:8080/internal/expire
